forms='minor 与 minus 是拉丁语相关形式；ministr- 见于 minister、ministrare 的词干。administr- 加入 ad-，形成料理、管理的支线。minuscule 经 minusculus 小称形式；minstrel 经法语大幅缩短。',
branches=[['较小、较少','minor, minority, minus, minuscule, semiminor'],['管理事务','administer, administration, administrator, administrative'],['任职与宗教服务','minister, ministry, ministerial, ministerium'],['照顾和援助','ministration, ministrant, ministrate, ministrative'],['服务发展出的专名','minstrel, minstrelsy, minestrone, ministerialis']],
